Local configuration change approved by the user and applied; NOT deployed.
Purpose: allow only the existing services participating in lifecycle recovery
to reach the new Users lifecycle and Notifications connection RPCs.
File: deploy/messaging/accounts.yaml

USERS_RPC exports:
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle.node.*

NOTIFICATIONS_RPC exports:
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.notifications.connection.>
NOTIFICATIONS_RPC imports:
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle, from: USERS_RPC
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle.node.*, from: USERS_RPC

OUTGRESS_RPC imports:
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle, from: USERS_RPC
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle.node.*, from: USERS_RPC
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.projection.users.get, from: USERS_RPC
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.projection.users.get.node.*, from: USERS_RPC
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.notifications.connection.>, from: NOTIFICATIONS_RPC

PROJECTOR_RPC imports:
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle, from: USERS_RPC
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle.node.*, from: USERS_RPC

WORKER_RPC imports:
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle, from: USERS_RPC
  add service: bagel.rpc.internal.users.lifecycle.node.*, from: USERS_RPC

No account, credential, public client grant, token, signed JWT, or running
broker is changed. Signing/deployment remain separate operational steps.
